sed captions, generated on-device from your mic (stream-only, never in your headset). Mixed-reality facecam: your phone camera cuts you out (no green screen) and drops you into the game view. Text overlays, scenes (Gameplay / Starting Soon / BRB), stream timer. Alerts & TTS: gifts, follows, subs read aloud into the stream. One-tap clips: save the last 60 seconds. Connection fallback: if your stream drops, viewers see your fallback video with a Reconnecting badge while it fights back live. Adaptive quality: bitrate steps down when the network strains, back up when it recovers \u2014 the stream stays alive. Landscape or vertical (9:16 for TikTok / Shorts). SETUP: 1. Install with SideQuest or adb. 2. Enable Unknown Sources, launch from Unknown Sources in your library. 3. Paste your RTMP URL + stream key (Restream recommended for multi-platform). 4. Tap Start Stream. You're live. REQUIREMENTS: Meta Quest 3 / 3S. Wi-Fi. A Restream account (free) for multi-platform streaming, or any RTMP destination. Built by Zenxiety Games. Updates ship often.", "short_description": "The easiest streaming setup ever \u2014 stream VR straight from your Quest. No PC. No OBS."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sZrIgABErRQZhaQF94rRy2P_cazbaXBy/view?usp=drivesdk", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZenxietyGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ZenDragonVR", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"],